{"seq":3,"slug":"model-routing-cost","title":"多模型路由与生成成本控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-commerce-content-generation/prompt-pipeline/model-routing-cost","wordCount":2567,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"多模型路由与生成成本控制\">多模型路由与生成成本控制</h1><p>生成成本在电商内容场景里有一个特殊性质：它是<strong>规模乘出来的</strong>。单次生成的费用看起来微不足道——几分钱——但 100 万 SKU × 5 个语种 × 3 个字段 × 每月一次重刷就是千万次调用量级。在这个量级上，模型选择从&quot;效果够不够好&quot;变成了&quot;每千次生成差 3 倍价格&quot;的工程问题。同时，任务难度在真实数据里是<strong>重尾分布</strong>的：绝大多数 SKU 的属性简单、文案模板化，少数复杂品类（多规格、多材质、强合规）才需要最强模型。把这两件事放在一起，多模型路由就是一个必然的架构选择，而不是可选的优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>路由要解决的是一个带约束的最小化问题。设任务集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2542em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、可用模型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，任务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 用模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 生成的期望成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c(t,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，期望质量收益为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(t,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则目标可以写成：在满足&quot;每个任务的最低质量要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q(t,m) \\ge q_{\\min}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;与&quot;总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum c(t,m_t) \\le C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;的前提下，最大化总质量收益。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">T</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">M</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">T</mi></mrow></munder><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{m: \\mathcal{T} \\to \\mathcal{M}} \\sum_{t \\in \\mathcal{T}} q(t, m_t) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum_{t} c(t, m_t) \\le C,\\; q(t, m_t) \\ge q_{\\min}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2542em;\">T</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">M</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2542em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个形式化不值得直接求解（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 无法精确度量），但它的价值在于指出路由决策需要三个输入：<strong>成本模型、质量代理指标、任务难度估计</strong>。三者缺一，路由就只能靠拍脑袋。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[任务入队] --&gt; B[难度特征提取]&#10;    B --&gt; C{难度分层}&#10;    C --&gt;|简单: 属性完整/短文本/常见类目| D[小模型 / 缓存]&#10;    C --&gt;|中等: 稍有复杂| E[中型模型]&#10;    C --&gt;|困难: 多规格/强合规/罕见类目| F[前沿模型]&#10;    D --&gt; G{质量校验}&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt;|不达标| H[升级路由: 换更强模型重试一次]&#10;    H --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt;|达标| I[写回 + 记录模型与成本]&#10;    I --&gt; J[成本归因与路由策略迭代]\">graph TD\n    A[任务入队] --&gt; B[难度特征提取]\n    B --&gt; C{难度分层}\n    C --&gt;|简单: 属性完整/短文本/常见类目| D[小模型 / 缓存]\n    C --&gt;|中等: 稍有复杂| E[中型模型]\n    C --&gt;|困难: 多规格/强合规/罕见类目| F[前沿模型]\n    D --&gt; G{质量校验}\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt;|不达标| H[升级路由: 换更强模型重试一次]\n    H --&gt; G\n    G --&gt;|达标| I[写回 + 记录模型与成本]\n    I --&gt; J[成本归因与路由策略迭代]</pre><p>图中最重要的一条边是 <strong>G → H 的升级路由</strong>：先便宜后昂贵、校验失败才升级。这条策略在数学上优于先验地判断难度，因为它用<strong>实际的质量校验结果</strong>替代了对难度的猜测。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>小模型失败</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pr[\\text{小模型失败}] = p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小模型失败</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，则期望成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>small</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>large</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{small}} + p \\cdot c_{\\text{large}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">small</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">large</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 不太高，这个期望就显著低于直接使用大模型的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>large</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{large}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">large</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。它的前提是<strong>校验必须可靠</strong>——若校验漏放低质内容，升级路由就变成了质量事故的制造机。这正是 <a href=\"../quality-brand-control/generation-quality-gate\">3.1 生成质量校验与事实一致性</a> 与路由策略必须成对设计的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型能力与成本的分层框架\">模型能力与成本的分层框架</h2><p>具体选型会随供应商与版本频繁变化，因此工程上不应硬编码模型名，而应维护一个<strong>模型能力档位表</strong>，按档位路由，由配置把档位映射到当前具体模型。一个可用的分档维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>典型能力特征</th>\n<th>适用任务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Tier 0</td>\n<td>无模型</td>\n<td>确定性合成或缓存</td>\n<td>主图合成、命中缓存的任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 1</td>\n<td>小模型</td>\n<td>快、便宜，长文本一致性弱</td>\n<td>标题、五点、短文案、变体填充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 2</td>\n<td>中模型</td>\n<td>平衡，能处理多属性约束</td>\n<td>详情长文、场景图、多数营销文案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 3</td>\n<td>前沿模型</td>\n<td>强推理与长上下文，贵</td>\n<td>复杂类目、强合规文案、重写修正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本结构上，主流 API 的计价方式长期是<strong>按 token 分输入/输出两档定价，输出单价通常显著高于输入</strong>（常见倍率在 3–8 倍区间，各供应商不同）。这个结构决定了两个优化方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>压缩输入</strong>：提示词里的属性筛选（见 <a href=\"product-attribute-prompt\">2.1 商品属性注入与提示词模板</a> 的 token 预算公式）直接降低输入成本。</li>\n<li><strong>压缩输出</strong>：明确要求&quot;不要复述属性、不要写解释性文字、直接输出 JSON&quot;，能显著减少无效输出 token。让模型先说一段&quot;好的，我来为你生成……&quot;再给内容，是纯浪费。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>另外，多数供应商提供<strong>提示词缓存</strong>（对重复前缀的输入 token 计费折扣，常见折扣幅度在 50%–90%——以 Anthropic 的定价口径为例，缓存命中按基础输入价的 0.1× 计费，即约 90% 折扣，5 分钟 TTL 的缓存写入为 1.25×、1 小时 TTL 为 2×，最短可缓存长度按模型为 512–4096 token，来源：<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-caching），而电商场景的提示词恰恰有巨大的稳定前缀——系统指令与品牌层几乎不变，只有属性块变化。把提示词结构设计成&quot;稳定前缀在前、可变属性在后&quot;，就能吃到这笔折扣。这是一个纯收益的设计决策，但它要求模板分层（[2.1](1_product-attribute-prompt.md)\">https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-caching），而电商场景的提示词恰恰有巨大的稳定前缀——系统指令与品牌层几乎不变，只有属性块变化。把提示词结构设计成&quot;稳定前缀在前、可变属性在后&quot;，就能吃到这笔折扣。这是一个纯收益的设计决策，但它要求模板分层（[2.1](1_product-attribute-prompt.md)</a> 的四层结构）从设计之初就做对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存分层-最便宜的一次调用是不调用\">缓存分层：最便宜的一次调用是不调用</h2><p>在路由之上还有一层更彻底的成本控制：<strong>不调用模型</strong>。缓存按粒度分三层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>L1 精确缓存</strong>：以幂等键（<a href=\"batch-generation-workflow\">2.2 海量 SKU 批量生成编排</a> 定义的复合键）为索引，命中即返回。命中率取决于目录变更频率，在稳定期可达 50% 以上。</li>\n<li><strong>L2 段落级缓存</strong>：把生成结果按结构切分（每个卖点、每个段落），以段落输入为键缓存。价值在于部分变更时只需重生成变化的段落——SKU 的一个次要属性变化通常只影响一个卖点。</li>\n<li><strong>L3 模板级复用</strong>：同类目下差异极小的 SKU（如同一款商品的不同颜色），其文本骨架高度一致，可以只对差异部分调用模型。这一层需要谨慎：它容易产生&quot;内容雷同&quot;的问题，搜索引擎与平台对高度重复的商品描述有降权机制，因此 L3 只应在差异属性确实显著时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存层</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>命中收益</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 精确</td>\n<td>整个生成任务</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>无（幂等键保证语义相同）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 段落</td>\n<td>单个段落/卖点</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>上下文割裂导致段落间不连贯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 模板</td>\n<td>类目 + 差异槽位</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>内容雷同被降权</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>L2 的风险值得展开：段落独立生成会让五点卖点各自为政，出现重复或语气跳跃。规避方式是在段落缓存之上保留一次&quot;整体连贯性检查&quot;，或者只对结构独立的字段（如规格表段落）启用段落级缓存，对需要连贯叙述的部分禁用。</p>\n<p><strong>批处理接口</strong>是另一条独立的成本杠杆。主流供应商的异步批处理通道通常提供约五折的价格，代价是延迟升到小时级（OpenAI Batch API 官方为 50% 折扣、24 小时内完成，<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/batch）。它适合两类任务：全量重刷（无时效要求）与低优先级长尾\">https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/batch）。它适合两类任务：全量重刷（无时效要求）与低优先级长尾</a> SKU。把它接入编排层的方式就是多开一条队列，路由规则里增加一个&quot;时效性&quot;维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"token-计量与成本归因\">Token 计量与成本归因</h2><p>成本控制的前提是知道钱花在哪。这需要每次调用都记录一份结构化的计量记录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{task_key, sku_id, field, locale, tier, model_id,&#10; prompt_tokens, completion_tokens, cached_tokens,&#10; latency_ms, cost_estimate, quality_score, retry_of}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{task_key, sku_id, field, locale, tier, model_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> prompt_tokens, completion_tokens, cached_tokens,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> latency_ms, cost_estimate, quality_score, retry_of}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有了这些记录，可以回答几个对决策至关重要的问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按类目/语种/字段拆分的单位成本是多少？哪些组合的成本异常高（通常是属性过多或输出过长）？</li>\n<li>升级路由的触发率是多少？如果某类任务的大模型升级率超过 30%，说明分档策略把它们放错了档位，应当直接把它们路由到高档。</li>\n<li>缓存命中率与 token 缓存折扣的实际节省是多少？</li>\n<li>单位成本的趋势：同样的任务集，成本上升往往意味着提示词膨胀或模型定价变化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>成本归因的粒度要细到<strong>单个 SKU</strong>，因为这是唯一能与商业价值对接的粒度。一次生成花多少钱，只有和&quot;这个 SKU 的曝光与转化&quot;放在一起才构成有意义的判断——<a href=\"../multilingual-ai-content/content-performance-feedback\">4.3 内容转化效果反馈优化生成</a> 会把这条线接上。按预算分层的做法（高价值 SKU 用高档位、长尾用低档位）成立的前提正是有 SKU 级的成本与效果数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由策略的迭代与回归\">路由策略的迭代与回归</h2><p>路由策略本身需要被当作一个持续迭代的对象，而不是一次配置。迭代的方式是<strong>小流量实验</strong>：对同一类任务，一部分走当前策略、一部分走候选策略，比较质量分与单位成本。</p>\n<p>这里有一个必须防范的陷阱：<strong>优化成本的时间点会污染质量评估</strong>。如果为了省钱把某类任务降级到小模型，而质量校验恰好在同一时期被放松，那么&quot;成本下降&quot;会被错误归因。因此路由实验必须与质量指标（<a href=\"../quality-brand-control/generation-quality-gate\">3.1 生成质量校验与事实一致性</a> 定义的属性覆盖率、数字来源一致率等）<strong>同时监控</strong>，任何一个质量指标的恶化都应当触发策略回退。</p>\n<p>另一个实践中的经验是：<strong>降本不应以引入新失败模式为代价</strong>。把详情长文从 Tier 2 降到 Tier 1 省下的钱，如果导致人审队列变长一倍，那么总成本（含人审工时）可能是上升的。所以成本账必须算<strong>全口径成本</strong>：模型调用 + 校验算力 + 人审工时 + 重写重试。只看 API 账单做优化，是这类系统最常见的局部最优陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>任务难度呈重尾分布，路由是必然架构而非可选优化；形式化为&quot;约束下的质量收益最大化&quot;，需要成本模型、质量代理指标、难度估计三者作为输入。</li>\n<li><strong>升级路由</strong>（先便宜、校验失败才升级）优于先验难度判断，其期望成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>small</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>large</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{small}} + p \\cdot c_{\\text{large}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">small</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">large</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，前提是校验可靠。</li>\n<li>按能力档位而非模型名路由，用配置映射到具体模型，使选型变化不影响架构。</li>\n<li>成本结构上是输入/输出双档计价且输出更贵，配合提示词缓存（稳定前缀在前）能显著降本。</li>\n<li>缓存分三层（精确/段落/模板），L3 要警惕内容雷同被平台降权；批处理接口以延迟换约五折价格。</li>\n<li>成本归因必须细到 SKU 级并与商业价值对接；路由实验要与质量指标同时监控，并用<strong>全口径成本</strong>（含人审与重试）评估。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>流水线的三个环节到此完整。生成出来的内容凭什么能上线，由 <a href=\"../quality-brand-control/generation-quality-gate\">3.1 生成质量校验与事实一致性</a> 接手。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多模型路由与生成成本控制","id":"多模型路由与生成成本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模型能力与成本的分层框架","id":"模型能力与成本的分层框架"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存分层：最便宜的一次调用是不调用","id":"缓存分层-最便宜的一次调用是不调用"},{"level":2,"text":"Token 计量与成本归因","id":"token-计量与成本归因"},{"level":2,"text":"路由策略的迭代与回归","id":"路由策略的迭代与回归"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海量 SKU 批量生成编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-commerce-content-generation/prompt-pipeline/batch-generation-workflow"},"next":{"title":"生成质量校验与事实一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ai-commerce-content-generation/quality-brand-control/generation-quality-gate"}}